{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu059-e-sr-chenshu-comment","title":"陈寿评吴主五子","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu059-a-55af77f3c9fa16f74f99","label":"正文","text":"评曰：孙登居心所存足为茂美之德；虑、和并有好善之姿，或短命早终或不得其死；霸以庶干嫡、奋不遵轨度，固取危亡之道，然奋之诛夷横遇飞祸","evidence":["santizhu059-q-0fc3620f8ad6f1f53435"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-p0051","role":"评五子","evidence":["santizhu059-q-0fc3620f8ad6f1f53435"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-0fc3620f8ad6f1f53435"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-0fc3620f8ad6f1f53435","source_order":[59,293,0],"order":10503}],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-p0051","name":"陈寿","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu059-q-0fc3620f8ad6f1f53435","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-20d8fa185cfbf4b2aee0","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：孙登居心所存，足为茂美之德。虑、和并有好善之姿〖1〗，规自砥砺〖2〗；或短命早终，或不得其死：哀哉！霸以庶干嫡，奋不遵轨度，固取危亡之道也；然奋之诛夷，横遇飞祸矣。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
